      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/Meta|Meta]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/transformer|transformer]]\n- [[Technologies/fine-tuning|fine-tuning]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/diffusion|diffusion]]\n- [[Technologies/DPO|DPO]]\n- [[Technologies/attention|attention]]\n- [[Technologies/agentic|agentic]]\n- [[Technologies/function calling|function calling]]"
